    <summary>A portable IDE for linear and mixed-integer programming using GLPK.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[GUSEK (GLPK Under Scite Extended Kit) is an open-source Windows IDE for linear programming and mixed-integer linear programming. It combines a customized SciTE editor with the GLPK standalone solver and supports GNU MathProg (GMPL), MPS, and CPLEX LP models.

### Package notes

Keep your own models and data outside the Chocolatey package directory, which is removed on uninstall. Close GUSEK before upgrading or uninstalling.

### Package parameters

- `/NoDesktopShortcut` - Do not create a desktop shortcut.
- `/NoStartMenuShortcut` - Do not create a Start Menu shortcut.

Example: `choco install gusek --params="'/NoDesktopShortcut /NoStartMenuShortcut'"`

### Package updates

The package source includes an AU-compatible `update.ps1` script that checks the official SourceForge release folders and updates the version, download URL, and checksum.]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>https://gusek.sourceforge.net/gusek.html</releaseNotes>
